WEBVTT

00:03:28.796 --> 00:03:32.695
Of course a fig becomes possible

00:03:32.719 --> 00:03:37.246
when a lady wasp lays her eggs
inside a flower,

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.185
dies and decomposes,

00:03:40.209 --> 00:03:43.925
the fruit, evidence of her transformation.

00:03:43.949 --> 00:03:47.363
Sometimes, the poem is so bright,

00:03:47.387 --> 00:03:50.661
your silly language will not stick to it.

00:03:50.685 --> 00:03:54.019
Sometimes, the poem is so true,

00:03:54.043 --> 00:03:56.371
nobody will believe you.

00:03:56.395 --> 00:03:59.098
I am a bird

00:03:59.122 --> 00:04:01.840
made of birds.